# Read by `vite` in DEV mode only (`npm run dev` / `npm run dev:harness`), never
# by `vite build`, and excluded from `civitai app submit`'s upload.
#
# The bridge drops any message whose origin is not on this list. The same
# origins page-money allows in dev:
#   - http://localhost:5186 — the dev harness posts its fake BLOCK_INIT from the
#     dev server's own origin (port 5186 is pinned with `strictPort` in
#     vite.config.ts, and is `civitai app dev-tunnel`'s default);
#   - every Civitai domain (https://civitai.com, https://civitai.red,
#     https://civitai.green) — `npm run dev:tunnel` + `civitai app dev-tunnel`
#     embed this dev server in the REAL host, whose BLOCK_INIT comes from
#     whichever domain the page is open on. They are the same origins as
#     CIVITAI_PARENT_ORIGINS in src/dev-embed.ts, which the dev server's
#     frame-ancestors CSP is built from; keep the two lists equal.
# DEV-ONLY: production builds get the platform-injected value instead.
VITE_BLOCK_ALLOWED_PARENT_ORIGINS=http://localhost:5186,{{ civitaiParentOriginsCSV }}
